# 仅列出可进入源码版本控制的项目文件。新增交付文件需显式列入。
# 本地 Key、配置、runs、原题与个人资料默认忽略。
/*
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/DESIGN.md
!/实施计划.md
!/工作台需求与设计评审草案.md
!/质量门禁设计.md
!/workbench-harness.yaml
!/generate.py
!/verify-preview.mjs
!/workbench.py
!/README.md
!/design/
/design/*
!/design/root-workbench.html
!/design/root-account.html
!/design/root-version-history.html
!/design/root-workbench-entry.html
!/workbench/
/workbench/*
!/workbench/index.html
!/workbench/workbench.css
!/workbench/workbench.js
!/workbench/entry.js
!/tests/
/tests/*
!/tests/fixtures.py
!/tests/verify-workbench.mjs
!/tests/test_generation.py
!/tests/verify-webrtc-isolation.mjs
!/账号与工具设计.md
!/accounts.py
!/tests/test_accounts.py
